  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 209.02 Burden of Proof. In all proceedings governed by this chapter the party asserting the affirmative of a proposition shall have the burden of proving the truth of that proposition.\n\nSource. #6348, eff 10-5-96, EXPIRED: 10-5-04\n\nNew. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05 (from Ed 210.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed200.html"
